    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Les ann\u00e9es 90. Lina, 18 ans, d\u00e9barque \u00e0 Paris pour ses \u00e9tudes. Elle vient chercher ce qu\u2019elle n\u2019a jamais trouv\u00e9 au Liban, son pays d\u2019origine : une certaine forme de libert\u00e9. L\u2019instinct de survie comme seul bagage, elle vogue d\u2019un Paris \u00e0 l\u2019autre au rythme de ses rencontres amoureuses. Parce qu\u2019\u00e0 18 ans, on r\u00eave d\u2019embrasser le monde et pas qu\u2019un seul gar\u00e7on.",
        "english": "The 1990s. Eighteen-year-old Lina arrives in Paris to study. She has come to find what she has never found in her homeland of Lebanon: a certain kind of freedom. With a survival instinct as her only luggage, she floats around from one Paris to another to the rhythm of her love affairs. Because, when you are eighteen years old, you dream of embracing the whole world and not just a single boy.."
